      "header": "Structured answers for process decisions",
      "description": "Receive typed answers, confidence scores, and probabilities as process data. Route work, prioritize cases, or trigger reviews using Camunda gateway conditions instead of parsing free-form AI text.",
      "hideOnOverview": false,
      "position": 2,
      "characteristics": []
    },
    {
